{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:07c7bf0c863ac8aa","name":"Shield Generator System","source":{"id":"source:reference-07c7bf0c863ac8aa","title":"Shield Generator System","revision":18489,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:12:15Z","sha256":"01ba8271ead7f5e1408816555040302473c4e3ce8756ae456569a6496156a08a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18489","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Shield%20Generator%20System&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-07c7bf0c863ac8aa","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SYSTEM\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["COST\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["WEIGHT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["AVAILABILITY\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["SR 5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2,500 x ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cost Factor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cost_Factor"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["(10 x Cost Factor) kg\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["SR 10\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["5,000 x Cost Factor\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["(20 x Cost Factor) kg\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["SR 15\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["7,500 x Cost Factor\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["(30 x Cost Factor) kg\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["SR 20\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["10,000 x Cost Factor\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["(40 x Cost Factor) kg\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Military"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Military"},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["A Droid can be fitted with a deflector Shield Generator- the same type mounted on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"},". Whenever the Droid would take damage, reduce the damage by the Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," (SR). If the damage is equal to or greater than the Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},", the Droid's SR is reduced by 5. By spending three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Actions"}," on the same or consecutive rounds, the Droid may make a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endurance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endurance","referenceId":"reference:98c8abf84e23ff3f"}," check to restore lost shield power. If the check succeeds, the Droid's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"}," increases by 5 points (up to its normal SR).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Due to the size and energy requirements of Shield Generator Systems, only Droids of Small size or larger can be equipped with a SR 10 Generator. Only Droids of Medium size or larger can be equipped with a SR 15 generator. Only Droids of Large or bigger size can be equipped with a SR 20 generator. \n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
